INSTALLTING OF F5-NGINX-CONTROLLER

1) Install Helm first on your computer and user helm to install F5-nginx controller

choco install kubernetes-helm

2) Export your kubernetes KUBECONFIG FILE SO YOU CAN HAVE ACCESS TO YOUR CLUSTER
POWERSHELL = $env:KUBECONFIG = "$(Get-Location)/../singlecluster.yaml"
GIT-BASH = export KUBECONFIG=../mysinglecluster.yaml

3) Install the F5 Nginx Controller

helm repo add nginx-stable https://helm.nginx.com/stable
helm repo update

kubectl create namespace nginx-ingress
helm install nginx-ingress nginx-stable/nginx-ingress --namespace nginx-ingress --set controller.service.type=LoadBalancer

4) Verify it 
------------
kubectl get svc -n nginx-ingress
